<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Estúdio Ao Vivo — DJ ÁGUIA1</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0E1120;
    --surface:#171B30;
    --surface-2:#1F2440;
    --gold:#E8B84B;
    --sky:#6FA3D8;
    --text:#EDEEF5;
    --muted:#9BA0C0;
    --line:#2A2F52;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% -10%, #1B2044 0%, var(--bg) 55%);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'Manrope', sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}

  /* Header */
  header{
    padding:20px 24px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .brand-mark{
    width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #B9862E);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:700; color:#1A1300; font-size:18px;
  }
  .brand-name{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:0.3px;}
  nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  /* Hero / live status */
  .hero{
    padding:60px 24px 40px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .status{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    padding:7px 16px;border-radius:999px;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  .dot{
    width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;
    background:#4CD97B;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(76,217,123,0.6);
    animation:pulse 1.8s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{
    0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(76,217,123,0.55);}
    70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(76,217,123,0);}
    100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(76,217,123,0);}
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);
    max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 14px;
    line-height:1.15;
  }
  .hero h1 span{color:var(--gold);}
  .hero p{color:var(--muted);max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;}

  /* Player */
  .player-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:26px;
    margin:40px auto 0;
    max-width:640px;
  }
  .player-card iframe{
    width:100%;
    height:150px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#000;
  }
  .player-links{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:14px;
    margin-top:18px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    padding:11px 20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--gold);color:#1A1300;border-color:var(--gold);}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--sky);color:var(--sky);}

  /* Vídeo ao vivo */
  section{padding:56px 24px;}
  .section-head{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-align:center;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;}

  .video-frame{
    max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;
    border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface);
    aspect-ratio:16/9;
  }
  .video-frame iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:none;display:block;}

  /* Locutor + Programação */
  .grid-two{
    max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;
  }
  @media (max-width:680px){.grid-two{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  .card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:26px;
  }
  .card h3{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--gold);}
  .schedule-item{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:14px;
  }
  .schedule-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .schedule-item time{color:var(--sky);font-weight:600;}

  footer{
    text-align:center;padding:34px 24px;
    color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-mark">A1</div>
    <div class="brand-name">DJ ÁGUIA1</div>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#player">Estúdio</a>
    <a href="#locutor">Locutor</a>
    <a href="#programacao">Programação</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span> No ar agora</div>
  <h1>Estúdio <span>Ao Vivo</span></h1>
  <p>Música autoral gospel, dance e trance de adoração, transmitida direto do estúdio.</p>
</div>

<div class="player-card" id="player">
  <iframe src="https://djaguia1.ismyradio.com/player" title="Player Web Rádio DJ ÁGUIA1"></iframe>
  <div class="player-links">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://djaguia1.ismyradio.com/player" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Ouvir agora</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.youtube.com/@djaguia1/streams" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver no YouTube</a>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Transmissão em vídeo</h2>
    <p>Acompanhe a live do estúdio também em vídeo, direto do canal no YouTube.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="video-frame">
    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/live_stream?channel=djaguia1" title="Live YouTube DJ ÁGUIA1" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="grid-two">
    <div class="card" id="locutor">
      <h3>Locutor</h3>
      <p>DJ ÁGUIA1 comanda o estúdio, apresentando músicas autorais de adoração e conduzindo a programação ao vivo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="programacao">
      <h3>Programação</h3>
      <div class="schedule-item"><span>Manhã de Louvor</span><time>07h–09h</time></div>
      <div class="schedule-item"><span>Gospel Dance</span><time>12h–14h</time></div>
      <div class="schedule-item"><span>Trance de Adoração</span><time>19h–21h</time></div>
      <div class="schedule-item"><span>Noite Autoral</span><time>22h–00h</time></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  DJ ÁGUIA1 — Web Rádio Gospel · djrenatobravo.com.br
</footer>

</body>
</html>

